#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The Organization console shows your details, your members and your workspaces. Org-admins remove members, create, rename and archive workspaces, and open the security policy, single sign-on, SCIM provisioning and the audit log from it. An Organization with other members always keeps at least one enabled org-admin."
